# 2-bit multiplier of the lecture
vars s3 s2 s1 s0 c1 p11 p10 p01 p00 a1 a0 b1 b0
order lex
spec 8*s3 + 4*s2 + 2*s1 + s0 - (2*a1 + a0)*(2*b1 + b0)
-s3 + p11*c1
-s2 + p11 + c1 - 2*p11*c1
-c1 + p01*p10
-s1 + p01 + p10 - 2*p01*p10
-s0 + p00
-p00 + a0*b0
-p01 + a0*b1
-p10 + a1*b0
-p11 + a1*b1
a1^2 - a1
a0^2 - a0
b1^2 - b1
b0^2 - b0
